Description: Kurokesu camera test bench tool for Raspberry Pi
 Single-operator bench GUI for validating Kurokesu Raspberry Pi camera
 modules: live viewfinder, sensor selection (writes the dtoverlay) and
 signal-integrity surfacing. Runs fullscreen under a Cage kiosk.
 .
 Installs the application tree to /opt/camlab and restarts a running
 camlab.service. Service wiring, boot tuning and the read-only overlay
 stay with the repo install script for now.
